Part 2 in my ongoing effort to bring my old patches up to date:

My lenses patch is now available for 3.4.1 from my patches web-page
[1].

This patch expands on the lenses object, converting several "visual
effect" rings into pairs of lenses, and adding a couple of new lense
types. As it adds new objects to the game, it will certainly affect
save-file compatibility.

Once again, I have not rigorously tested the patch under 3.4.1. I've
just resolved the issues necessary to make it compile and given it a
brief test. Any feedback (feature requests, bug reports, gifts of
gold, frankincense, myrrh, &c) would be appreciated.

